msgstr ""
"OLSRd-plugin-modulen leser informasjon om meshed-nettverk fra txtinfo-"
"pluginen til OLSRd."

#: applications/luci-app-statistics/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/statistics/plugins/openvpn.js:8
msgid ""
"The OpenVPN plugin gathers information about the current vpn connection "
"status."
msgstr ""
"OpenVPN-pluginen samler informasjon om gjeldende vpn-tilkoblingsstatus."

#: applications/luci-app-statistics/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/statistics/plugins/syslog.js:7
msgid ""
"The SysLog plugin receives log messages from the daemon and dispatches them "
"to syslog."
msgstr ""
"SysLog-pluginet mottar loggmeldinger fra demonen og sender dem til syslog."

#: applications/luci-app-statistics/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/statistics/plugins/iptables.js:132
